;SEQUENCE ADVISORY NOTICE:
SEQUENCE FOR TRYPSIN IN THIS STRUCTURE WAS TAKEN FROM
GENEMBL WHICH DIFFERS FROM SWISSPROT SEQUENCE AT POSITIONS
61 AND 65.

SEQUENCE ADVISORY NOTICE
     DIFFERENCE BETWEEN SWISS-PROT AND PDB SEQUENCE.

